# Patch 0952 (wish of DevJunior, 23.11.2026: "that she at least dodges the blows, depending on the situation, so that
# she is not overpowered"; 25.11.2026: "that she can still keep firing and does not crouch if I aim at her").
# Not a bug of the prototype: a port feature of the mods with runtime/ashley_gun.cpp.
# src/game/pl_npc.cpp cSubChar::setDamage (an enemy's blow on the partner): re4_ashley_dodge may let Ashley duck it
# (her crouch, routine 4) instead: then no damage, no damage motion. cSubChar::cautionCheck (Leon aiming at her) and
# moveKagamu (held down while Leon aims): not while re4_ashley_no_caution (she carries a pistol): she stays up.
